     zero safe-zone margin) into this adaptive-icon foreground slot, so every
     launcher's own mask cropped it aggressively, showing only a zoomed-in
     sliver of the circle. Adaptive icons need real content confined to the
     inner ~66% safe zone; this vector keeps the original car+pin geometry
     from icons/icon.svg (already reasonably centered) with the background
     circle removed entirely — the OS-drawn gradient background
     (ic_launcher_bg_gradient.xml) shows through instead. -->
